                            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/yxqnJ7HD4sU" title="【2025信託女子公開賽∣邀您為選手們加油】" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                            <div class="c-video__more">
                                <div class="c-video__text">
                                    <span class="t6 t-bold t-lh12 t-ls-sm">看不了影片嗎？</span>
